# LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# The other half of the Windows-clone problem 94fec8d started on. That commit
# stopped git turning tools/cosmo-ld-* into text files; this stops it turning
# them into CRLF ones. `#!/bin/sh\r` fails with "bad interpreter", naming
# neither git nor line endings, and every script here is on the build path:
# the linker shims, the driver, the toolchain assimilator, the test suite.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Extracted tables and generated assets: bytes, not text to be normalised.
*.json -text
data/** -text
